    <description>SoundGeek cleans up a recording on your own machine and writes the result beside the
original. Nothing is uploaded, so an interview or a meeting never leaves the computer.

* Remove background noise: hiss, a fan, traffic, room tone
* Find and remove mains hum completely, 50 Hz or 60 Hz, measured rather than assumed
* Even out the loudness to a target you pick, measured to ITU-R BS.1770
* Three levels of cleanup, and the app is plain about what each one costs
* No account, no adverts, no bundled offers, no per-minute charge

Open source under GPL-3.0. The .NET 8 runtime is bundled, so there is nothing to install first.</description>
    <summary>Free offline audio cleanup for Windows, noise, hum and levels, on your own machine</summary>
